      "mode": 0,
      "inputs": [
        {
          "name": "text",
          "type": "STRING",
          "link": null,
          "widget": {
            "name": "text"
          }
        }
      ],
      "outputs": [],
      "properties": {
        "Node name for S&R": "MarkdownNote"
      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "Three **File: Add** nodes hand Wan its files. Each names the field, the name Wan gives that input: the host, then the product, go to `reference_image_urls`, and the voice clip to `reference_audio_urls`. **Scene** calls them Image 1, Image 2, and Audio 1, in this order. Chain more **File: Add** nodes for up to 10 images and five clips."
      ],
      "title": "Note"
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "type": "MarkdownNote",
      "pos": [
        3290,
        60
      ],
      "size": [
