      "outputs": [],
      "properties": {
        "Node name for S&R": "MarkdownNote"
      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "Wan 3.0 films the host with the product, five seconds at 480p in a 9:16 frame, speaking the words in **Scene** in the voice from **Speak**. `reference_audio_urls` is a list on fal, so the one clip goes as a list of one.\n\nIf you cancel while the request still waits in fal's queue, fal drops it and bills nothing. A request fal has already started may still finish and be billed. Collect it with **video-05-recover-a-video**."
      ],
      "title": "Note"
    },
